{
 "captions": [
  {
   "duration": 1375,
   "content": "上大学那会儿，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 621
  },
  {
   "duration": 1584,
   "content": "我是学政务专业的，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 3329
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "意味着我得写很多论文。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 4913
  },
  {
   "duration": 2041,
   "content": "当一名普通的学生写论文时，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 7413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2375,
   "content": "他们也许会像这样，\n把任务分摊开。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 9496
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "所以，你明白",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 11871
  },
  {
   "duration": 1625,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 13079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1833,
   "content": "开始可能有点慢，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 14746
  },
  {
   "duration": 2000,
   "content": "但是一个星期过后已经写了不少，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 16579
  },
  {
   "duration": 1834,
   "content": "接下来有时写的更多一些，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 18579
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "最后一切搞定，事情不会搞砸。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 20454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1208,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 22621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "我也想这样。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 23829
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "至少我的计划是这样。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 26163
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "我准备好开始，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 27371
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "然而，事实上，到写论文的时候，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 29871
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "我是这么做的。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 32412
  },
  {
   "duration": 2375,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 34371
  },
  {
   "duration": 2166,
   "content": "而且每次写论文都这样。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 36746
  },
  {
   "duration": 3875,
   "content": "最后到了写90页毕业论文的时候，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 39621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "本应该花一年时间去写的论文。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 43537
  },
  {
   "duration": 3583,
   "content": "我知道对于这样一篇论文来说，\n我平常的做法行不通。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 45871
  },
  {
   "duration": 1416,
   "content": "毕业论文是个大项目。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 49496
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "于是我计划好，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 50912
  },
  {
   "duration": 3208,
   "content": "决定这么去做。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 52079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1459,
   "content": "一年的工作就这么安排。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 55787
  },
  {
   "duration": 1958,
   "content": "起初少干点儿，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 57246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2333,
   "content": "中间几个月持续干多一点儿，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 59246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "最后高速档全力以赴",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 61579
  },
  {
   "duration": 1417,
   "content": "就像小台阶一样。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 64246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2042,
   "content": "爬台阶能有多难？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 65704
  },
  {
   "duration": 1292,
   "content": "没什么大不了的，对吧？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 68246
  },
  {
   "duration": 1834,
   "content": "但是接下来，有趣的事发生了。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 71079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1333,
   "content": "起初那几个月？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 72913
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "来了又走，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 74788
  },
  {
   "duration": 1583,
   "content": "我基本没干什么。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 75996
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "于是就有了这个\n很棒的修改计划。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 77579
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 79454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "再然后......",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 80663
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 81829
  },
  {
   "duration": 2792,
   "content": "中间几个月竟然就这么过去了，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 83746
  },
  {
   "duration": 2208,
   "content": "我基本上没写几个字，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 86538
  },
  {
   "duration": 1833,
   "content": "所以变成了这样。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 88746
  },
  {
   "duration": 2583,
   "content": "然后从还有两个月到还有一个月，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 91496
  },
  {
   "duration": 1625,
   "content": "再到只剩两星期。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 94079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1292,
   "content": "然后有一天我突然意识到",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 95746
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "离截止期只剩三天了，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 97704
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "而我还一个字都没写呢，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 101496
  },
  {
   "duration": 2042,
   "content": "于是我做了我唯一能做的事：",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 103454
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "我花了72小时写出90页，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 105538
  },
  {
   "duration": 2291,
   "content": "通宵整整两天赶工",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 108163
  },
  {
   "duration": 2584,
   "content": "人不应该连续熬两个通宵",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 110454
  },
  {
   "duration": 2000,
   "content": "全速穿过校园，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 114371
  },
  {
   "duration": 1500,
   "content": "慢动作潜入，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 116371
  },
  {
   "duration": 2041,
   "content": "赶在截止期之前交了论文。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 117913
  },
  {
   "duration": 2000,
   "content": "我以为一切就这么结束了。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 119996
  },
  {
   "duration": 1541,
   "content": "结果一个星期之后我接到一通电话，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 122038
  },
  {
   "duration": 1458,
   "content": "是学校打来的。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 123621
  },
  {
   "duration": 1667,
   "content": "他们问：“你是蒂姆·尔班吗？”",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 125746
  },
  {
   "duration": 1458,
   "content": "我说，“没错”。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 127413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2333,
   "content": "他们说：“我们得和你\n谈一下论文的事儿。”",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 128913
  },
  {
   "duration": 1250,
   "content": "我回答，”好“",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 131288
  },
  {
   "duration": 1250,
   "content": "对方接着说,",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 133454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "\"这是我们看过最棒的一篇论文。“",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 135246
  },
  {
   "duration": 1708,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 137163
  },
  {
   "duration": 2708,
   "content": "（鼓掌）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 139996
  },
  {
   "duration": 1292,
   "content": "那并未发生。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 144954
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 146288
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "这篇论文写得非常非常烂。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 148413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2250,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 151079
  },
  {
   "duration": 4083,
   "content": "我只是想享受一下这个时刻，\n当你们全部以为，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 153371
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "“这家伙太牛了！“",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 157496
  },
  {
   "duration": 1375,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 159413
  },
  {
   "duration": 1666,
   "content": "不是这样的，那篇论文超级烂。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 160788
  },
  {
   "duration": 3417,
   "content": "不管怎么样，我现在是个博文作者。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 163329
  },
  {
   "duration": 1708,
   "content": "我为“打破砂锅问到底”写博文。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 166788
  },
  {
   "duration": 3750,
   "content": "几年前我决定\n写一篇关于拖延的文章。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 168538
  },
  {
   "duration": 3291,
   "content": "我的拖延行为总是让\n我身边那些不拖延的人感到困惑，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 172288
  },
  {
   "duration": 3667,
   "content": "所以我想向不拖延的人解释一下",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 175621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2084,
   "content": "拖延者脑袋里到底是怎么想的，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 179329
  },
  {
   "duration": 1417,
   "content": "还有为什么我们这些拖延者会这样。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 181454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "我的假设是",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 182913
  },
  {
   "duration": 2875,
   "content": "拖延者的大脑",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 184079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1959,
   "content": "和不拖延者的大脑是不同的。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 186954
  },
  {
   "duration": 2167,
   "content": "为了证明这一点，\n我找到一个核磁共振实验室",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 189704
  },
  {
   "duration": 2416,
   "content": "让我可以扫描自己的大脑",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 191913
  },
  {
   "duration": 2667,
   "content": "和一个经证实不是拖延者的大脑，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 194371
  },
  {
   "duration": 1458,
   "content": "然后我就可以对比这两种大脑。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 197038
  },
  {
   "duration": 2208,
   "content": "今天我把它们都带来了。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 198496
  },
  {
   "duration": 3500,
   "content": "我希望大家能认真比较\n这二者之间是否有什么差别。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 200746
  },
  {
   "duration": 2333,
   "content": "我知道大家\n不是受过训练的脑科专家，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 204288
  },
  {
   "duration": 2250,
   "content": "看起来可能不明显，\n但是让我们来看一下，好吗？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 206621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "这是一个不拖延者的大脑。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 208913
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 211829
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "现在，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 214121
  },
  {
   "duration": 1292,
   "content": "这是我的大脑。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 216329
  },
  {
   "duration": 2708,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 218288
  },
  {
   "duration": 1584,
   "content": "这二者之间有一个区别。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 223704
  },
  {
   "duration": 2375,
   "content": "两种大脑里头\n都有一个理性的决策制定者，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 225913
  },
  {
   "duration": 1625,
   "content": "但是拖延者的大脑里，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 228329
  },
  {
   "duration": 2958,
   "content": "还有一只叫即时满足的猴子。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 229996
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "对拖延者来说这意味着什么呢？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 232996
  },
  {
   "duration": 2417,
   "content": "它意味着在这件事\n发生之前一切都挺好的。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 235329
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "[现在是开始干活的最佳时机.] \n[才不是呢!]",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 237788
  },
  {
   "duration": 2917,
   "content": "于是当理性的决策制定者\n做出理性的决策，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 240454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "想做一些富有成效的事时，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 243413
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "猴子不想这么做，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 245329
  },
  {
   "duration": 1500,
   "content": "于是他开始掌控方向盘，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 247288
  },
  {
   "duration": 2875,
   "content": "而且他说：“实际上，\n让我们来读一下维基百科上关于",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 248829
  },
  {
   "duration": 2167,
   "content": "南茜·克里根/汤妮·雅哈丁\n的丑闻案吧，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 251704
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "因为我刚想起来这件事。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 253871
  },
  {
   "duration": 1000,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 256038
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "然后",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 257079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1292,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 258246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2041,
   "content": "然后让我们走到冰箱，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 259538
  },
  {
   "duration": 2833,
   "content": "翻翻看这10分钟以来\n有没什么新东西。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 261621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2625,
   "content": "之后，让我们继续\n在视频网站上浏览，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 264496
  },
  {
   "duration": 3250,
   "content": "从理查德·费曼\n谈磁性的视频开始看，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 267163
  },
  {
   "duration": 2709,
   "content": "一直看到\n对贾斯汀·比伯老妈的采访",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 270454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "看到地老天荒。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 273163
  },
  {
   "duration": 2209,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 275079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1750,
   "content": "“这一切都花时间,",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 277288
  },
  {
   "duration": 3500,
   "content": "所以我们今天的日程安排\n没办法抽空干活。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 279079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1167,
   "content": "很抱歉！“",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 282621
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "（叹气）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 283788
  },
  {
   "duration": 3375,
   "content": "这是怎么回事呢？",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 286329
  },
  {
   "duration": 2667,
   "content": "即时满足猴子似乎不是那个",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 291496
  },
  {
   "duration": 1250,
   "content": "你想让他操控方向盘的人。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 294204
  },
  {
   "duration": 1959,
   "content": "他完全活在当下。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 295454
  },
  {
   "duration": 2834,
   "content": "他没有过去的记忆，\n没有对未来的认识，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 297454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1708,
   "content": "他只关心两件事：",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 300288
  },
  {
   "duration": 1708,
   "content": "简单和快乐。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 301996
  },
  {
   "duration": 3084,
   "content": "在动物世界里，这样没问题。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 304329
  },
  {
   "duration": 1209,
   "content": "如果你是一条狗，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 307454
  },
  {
   "duration": 3583,
   "content": "你简单、快乐地度过这一生，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 308663
  },
  {
   "duration": 1166,
   "content": "就已经是巨大的成功！",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 312288
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 313454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1291,
   "content": "而对于猴子来说，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 315413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "人类是另外一种动物。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 317954
  },
  {
   "duration": 4500,
   "content": "你睡好、吃饱、繁殖下一代，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 320079
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "这么做在部落时代或许没问题。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 324621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2875,
   "content": "但是，假如你还没注意到，\n我们现在不是生活在部落时代。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 326913
  },
  {
   "duration": 4125,
   "content": "我们处于一个先进的文明，\n而猴子根本不懂那是什么。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 329788
  },
  {
   "duration": 2292,
   "content": "这就是为什么我们脑袋里还有另外一个家伙，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 333954
  },
  {
   "duration": 2375,
   "content": "理性的决策制定者，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 336246
  },
  {
   "duration": 3000,
   "content": "他让我们有能力去做\n其他动物无法做到的事情。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 338663
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "我们可以预见未来。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 341704
  },
  {
   "duration": 1750,
   "content": "我们可以顾全大局。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 343663
  },
  {
   "duration": 1375,
   "content": "我们可以做长期打算。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 345413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "而且他想把这些都考虑进去。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 346788
  },
  {
   "duration": 1708,
   "content": "他想让我们做",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 350121
  },
  {
   "duration": 2959,
   "content": "任何值得现在去做的事儿。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 351829
  },
  {
   "duration": 1375,
   "content": "有时做简单快乐的事",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 354829
  },
  {
   "duration": 2000,
   "content": "是有意义的，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 356246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2166,
   "content": "比如吃饭、睡觉",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 358288
  },
  {
   "duration": 1834,
   "content": "或者享受应得的休闲时光。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 360454
  },
  {
   "duration": 1417,
   "content": "这就是为什么即时满足猴子\n和理性的决策制定者之间有重合。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 362329
  },
  {
   "duration": 1750,
   "content": "有时他们意见一致。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 363788
  },
  {
   "duration": 2833,
   "content": "但是有时，更有意义的是",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 365538
  },
  {
   "duration": 3583,
   "content": "去做那些比较难\n而且不那么让人享受的事情，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 368413
  },
  {
   "duration": 1541,
   "content": "这是出于全局的考虑。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 372038
  },
  {
   "duration": 1917,
   "content": "此时二者之间会产生冲突。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 373579
  },
  {
   "duration": 1333,
   "content": "对于拖延者来说，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 375996
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "每次冲突都以这种方式结束，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 377371
  },
  {
   "duration": 3750,
   "content": "就是他在橙色区域\n花费了大量时间，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 379871
  },
  {
   "duration": 4333,
   "content": "这是那个简单又快乐，\n但是又没有意义的那个区域。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 383621
  },
  {
   "duration": 2250,
   "content": "我把这片区域称为黑暗的操场。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 387996
  },
  {
   "duration": 1625,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 390288
  },
  {
   "duration": 3166,
   "content": "黑暗的操场是一个",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 391913
  },
  {
   "duration": 3209,
   "content": "所有拖延者都很了解的地方。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 395079
  },
  {
   "duration": 1833,
   "content": "这里是在本来不应该休闲的时候",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 398871
  },
  {
   "duration": 3334,
   "content": "的休闲娱乐的活动场所。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 400704
  },
  {
   "duration": 1875,
   "content": "在黑暗的操场得到的快乐",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 404413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2500,
   "content": "其实并不是快乐，\n因为它完全是不劳而获的，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 406329
  },
  {
   "duration": 3209,
   "content": "这会带来内疚、恐惧、\n焦虑、自我憎恨",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 408829
  },
  {
   "duration": 2125,
   "content": "这是所有拖延者的感受。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 412079
  },
  {
   "duration": 3459,
   "content": "而且问题是，在这种情况下，\n由猴子掌控着方向盘，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 414704
  },
  {
   "duration": 3584,
   "content": "怎么能让拖延者把自己\n带去蓝色区域那边呢，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 418204
  },
  {
   "duration": 3250,
   "content": "那边虽然没那么舒适，\n但是有很多重要的事情要做。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 421829
  },
  {
   "duration": 5042,
   "content": "其实拖延者有个守护天使，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 425121
  },
  {
   "duration": 3208,
   "content": "总是看不起他并且看守着他，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 430163
  },
  {
   "duration": 1416,
   "content": "在那些最黑暗的时刻",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 433413
  },
  {
   "duration": 2083,
   "content": "它被称为恐慌怪兽。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 434871
  },
  {
   "duration": 3083,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 436996
  },
  {
   "duration": 4875,
   "content": "恐慌怪兽大部分时间都在冬眠，",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 442371
  },
  {
   "duration": 3917,
   "content": "但是截止期很靠近的时候\n或者处于在公众面前出丑的危险中时，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 447246
  },
  {
   "duration": 2042,
   "content": "或面临事业灾难时，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 451204
  },
  {
   "duration": 2542,
   "content": "或有其他可怕的后果时，\n它就会突然醒来。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 453246
  },
  {
   "duration": 4166,
   "content": "而且重要的是，\n他是猴子唯一害怕的东西。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 455788
  },
  {
   "duration": 4583,
   "content": "最近在我的生活里，\n恐慌怪兽变得相当重要，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 459996
  },
  {
   "duration": 3250,
   "content": "因为TED的工作人员\n6个月之前联络过我，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 464579
  },
  {
   "duration": 2000,
   "content": "邀请我做一次演讲。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 467871
  },
  {
   "duration": 2416,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 469913
  },
  {
   "duration": 1916,
   "content": "当然，我答应啦。",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 475038
  },
  {
   "duration": 3792,
   "content": "我以前一直梦想着\n可以做一次TED演讲。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 476996
  },
  {
   "duration": 3959,
   "content": "（笑声）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 480829
  },
  {
   "duration": 3667,
   "content": "（鼓掌）",
   "startOfParagraph": true,
   "startTime": 484829
  },
  {
   "duration": 1959,
   "content": "但是在这种兴奋中，",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 492204
  },
  {
   "duration": 3292,
   "content": "理性的决策制定者\n似乎在想别的事。",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 494204
  },
  {
   "duration": 2541,
   "content": "他会说：\n“我们清楚刚才答应了什么吗？",
   "startOfParagraph": false,
   "startTime": 497538
  }
 ]
}